r.com/a/IfLysDZ", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yoshichinoe/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c4c5e6d8/uploads/origins/e20d96c9-68f9-4c56-96b7-c2f60ee902aa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34ad158f0cfbf9ea43a068a28b854dc5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c4c5e6d8/uploads/origins/e20d96c9-68f9-4c56-96b7-c2f60ee902aa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34ad158f0cfbf9ea43a068a28b854dc5, https://si.imgix.net/c4c5e6d8/uploads/origins/e20d96c9-68f9-4c56-96b7-c2f60ee902aa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6bd39d4c66be4f8220dfb8dfa7b3ca14 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c4c5e6d8/uploads/origins/e20d96c9-68f9-4c56-96b7-c2f60ee902aa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=08d80181aa9c17d9d306338cd5a0ba45 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの作品はとても美しいです。\n\n私のキャラクターと友人を仲良く描いてもらえませんか？\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/IfbgMGW\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/dbnECJg", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yoshichinoe/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/91a1a2a7/uploads/origins/9e4258f7-067a-4751-99e7-6ba418dd2e16?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6679bae242f4d4ff847d605022cfb3c5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/91a1a2a7/uploads/origins/9e4258f7-067a-4751-99e7-6ba418dd2e16?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6679bae242f4d4ff847d605022cfb3c5, https://si.imgix.net/91a1a2a7/uploads/origins/9e4258f7-067a-4751-99e7-6ba418dd2e16?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=63f5d9e3895a9198ee104400c8343508 2x, https://si.imgix.net/91a1a2a7/uploads/origins/9e4258f7-067a-4751-99e7-6ba418dd2e16?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=04e2ce9c0f0458af7944e008e55495d1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ビ